uare","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"9xErhLpjFcoA39AFeN3lUA","review_id":"DeidZTxp_Rsernn-tlLSOw","date":"2017-09-18T03:12:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9470651149749756,"text_excerpt":"This is one of my favorite restaurants in the entire city. It is definitely a dive, but the food is absolutely incredible. I was there for lunch on Friday and started with a bowl of their gumbo. One of the best in New Orleans -- delicious. On this visit, I had the garlic oyster po-boy, which was great. I really enjoyed it. The hands-down best thing on the menu is the Barbecue Shrimp Po-boy. it is simply divine. The bread is hollowed out and filled with the shrimp and butter sauce, which spill out of the sandwich and fill the entire plate. The shrimp are succulent and the sauce is heavenly. This is easily my favorite sandwich in the entire world. (I keep a picture of this on my phone so th..."},{"business_id":"9xErhLpjFcoA39AFeN3lUA","review_id":"k00RJob-o5-_K3sILqRO3A","date":"2018-05-14T22:38:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9455920457839966,"text_excerpt":"Came after local recommended this place and so happy we did! The gumbo is incredible, the bbq shrimp is like a mecca of shrimp scampi garlic fabulousness, and the Bloody Mary is great! Definitely share the bbq shrimp unless you have a football player type appetite. Also, got some fries -- fresh cut -- and remoulade to dip them in, which was awesome. Definitely worth a visit to this neighborhood place!"},{"business_id":"9xErhLpjFcoA39AFeN3lUA","review_id":"bF_Sj81FPqR46BGWLgZxyA","date":"2011-12-31T18:23:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9380402565002441,"text_excerpt":"Cool spot in a cool neighborhood. Doug and I went for lunch and both had their signature dish, the BBQ shrimp po boy. BBQ shrimp in New Orleans is shrimp sauteed in lots of butter with garlic and seasonings, and this sandwich skimps on nothing...loads of those little Gulf shrimp swimming in more butter than I care to ponder whilst checking out my expanding waistline, all well seasoned and served on a nice French bread. We also ordered up some of their sweet potato fries, which were delish. Good place to catch a Saints game if you're lucky enough to score a bar stool."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"9xErhLpjFcoA39AFeN3lUA","photo_id":"qAxXDR-UDSvE5A7lbKznGg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qAxXDR-UDSvE5A7lbKznGg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.882738471031189},{"business_id":"9xErhLpjFcoA39AFeN3lUA","photo_id":"fx0NN0MrHVklbf03KKuKmQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/fx0NN0MrHVklbf03KKuKmQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8374555706977844},{"business_id":"9xErhLpjFcoA39AFeN3lUA","photo_id":"QVRhsb67tUMW094c5SF-tA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/QVRhsb67tUMW094c5SF-tA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8189204931259155},{"business_id":"9xErhLpjFcoA39AFeN3lUA","photo_id":"ZGpY4ktPhA_dYHVIcZvR-w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ZGpY4ktPhA_dYHVIcZvR-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8151334524154663},{"business_id":"9xErhLpjFcoA39AFeN3lUA","photo_id":"Q5_v-t2BGkEIeNmVa5YIJA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Q5_v-t2BGkEIeNmVa5YIJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7584310173988342}]},"notebook_case":null}
